{"ID":"20230928084513-fqcefnp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20230928084513-fqcefnp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084513-fqcefnp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084518-520culz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084600-ey9827l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084600-ey9827l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【手少阴心经】","type":"doc","updated":"20230928084538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912165028-7273k51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912165028-7273k51","updated":"20240912173508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【手少阴心经穴位】：极泉穴、青灵穴、少海穴、灵道穴、通里穴、阴郄穴、神门穴、少府穴、少冲穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-520culz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-520culz","updated":"20230928084528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心为君主之官，不受病；心脏若有病，那也是心包膜生病，即膜包在心上面；（很多心病都是西药导致；心脏其脏坚固，不能容邪，容邪则死；）"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-m0vty41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-m0vty41","updated":"20230928084529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心藏神；心中有一滴血，供血都是心血取代旧血就如牛顿摆球运动，如受惊吓，心中血就会消失，没了缓冲作用，人就容易失神失眠；睡眠是心脏在管；抑郁、安眠类药物，会导致人精神失常，自杀；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-dqppxae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-dqppxae","updated":"20230928084530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心与小肠相表里；小肠火旺时，人体腹部就容易瘦，反之可以说，肚子肥大的人，也有可能是因为小肠火温度低导致；所以心脏也在管人的体重，管人的腰围；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-9o27hdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-9o27hdh","updated":"20230928084530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心之音属徴(zheng第一声)音；发声为'呵’；五脏逼毒法：找一面混凝土或硬墙，先调息，然后背靠撞墙，装上去之后，大力把气吐出来，发出‘呵’的声音；功夫深的话，即撞到墙同时，把气吐光"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-emvr4rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-emvr4rj","updated":"20230928084531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心主喜；喜伤心；心为火，肾为水克之又肾主恐，所以恐能胜喜；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-gmo6ter","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-gmo6ter","updated":"20230928084532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心，其华在面；两边脸颊通红时，则壮热，为心实；两边脸颊沧暗时，无血色就是虚症；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-0hjdggz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-0hjdggz","updated":"20230928084532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（因为心脏从脾脏收到的营养色为红色，有实症在心脏时，心脏不接收的营养就会反逆到脸上；反之亦然）"}]},{"ID":"20230928084522-efehhr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084522-efehhr2"}},{"ID":"20230928084518-690uwbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-690uwbe","updated":"20230928084533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t木\t脏\t少冲穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-yyiiztz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-yyiiztz","updated":"20230928084534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t火\t色\t少府穴\t心脏病的急救大穴；又名手解穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-yw8u4l9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-yw8u4l9","updated":"20230928084534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t土\t时\t神门穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-mtw2d29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-mtw2d29","updated":"20230928084535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t金\t音\t灵道穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-pjk34p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-pjk34p5","updated":"20230928084535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t水\t食\t少海穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084525-zbve0vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084525-zbve0vl"}},{"ID":"20230928084518-xmrla11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-xmrla11","updated":"20230928084536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通里穴：心经的络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084526-jzap70h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084526-jzap70h"}},{"ID":"20230928084518-w5hxh52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-w5hxh52","updated":"20230928084537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井为母穴时，补井当补合"}]},{"ID":"20230928084518-8k3p5np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084518-8k3p5np","updated":"20230928084538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井为子穴时，泻井当泻荣"}]},{"ID":"20230928084538-03rh8qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084538-03rh8qk"}},{"ID":"20230928084555-owpjm2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084555-owpjm2r","updated":"20230928084555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手太阴心经"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手太阴心经-20230928084555-10w3nfu.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928084558-w4vagyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084558-w4vagyp","updated":"20230928084558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手太阴心经1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手太阴心经1-20230928084558-zp6h30v.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928084600-ey9827l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084600-ey9827l","updated":"20230928084600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手太阴心经2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手太阴心经2-20230928084600-q57a1yq.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240912173527-wwkz5um","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240912173527-wwkz5um"}},{"ID":"20240912173528-f1b6p3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912173528-f1b6p3p"}}]}